documentation were adapted for Ix; the mathematical construction is retained.
Con-leche's Apache-2.0 license is preserved in LICENSE-CON-LECHE.

From port step L5 (2026-09-30) the file also carries the source's own
instance of `ConLeche.SetTheory` (`conLecheSetTheoryOfChain`,
`conLecheSetTheoryOfCarneiro`, `carneiro_implies_conleche`, the source's
`setTheoryOfChain`, `setTheoryOfCarneiro` and `carneiro_implies_conleche`
under prefixed names), reusing the shared lemmas. IxSetTheoryModel/Consistency.lean
is authored in this repository. At L6 (2026-10-01) the instance of Ix's own
class (`setTheoryOfChain`, `setTheoryOfCarneiro`, `carneiro_implies_ix`) was
removed with the intrinsic kernel, and the shared lemmas now state
con-leche's `IsTGUniverse` and `Equinumerous`, as the source does.
